# Run P (2026-11-07, user: "remove speeding threshold"): run O
# (slurm/sac_scratch_2t_u5_orterm_idle.env: SAC from scratch, no pretraining, one
# update every 5 env steps, off-road terminal with the junction rule, idle charge
# 0.5 below 2 km/h, Town05 + Town01) with NO arrival speed condition in training:
# GOAL_ARRIVAL_MAX_SPEED=0 -- arrival = entering the 2 m goal radius at any speed,
# in the env reward and in HER's hindsight arrivals (it was 10 km/h).
#
# Why: run O stalled (5-6 of 10 episodes, throttle < 0.05 on up to 28% of steps)
# once its actor went deterministic (~120k): every arrival demanded slowing to
# 10 km/h, its critic credited low throttle for the +100, and a stall is a cut-off,
# not a fault. Evals score each checkpoint BOTH ways -- VAL_TAG jr35 (10 km/h kept,
# c0 65 of 80) and jr35nb (il_eval_val_chw_jr_nb.env, no speed rule, c0 68 of 80
# with wrong-goal .65/.70) -- since without the rule lane following alone can reach
# goals ahead on the route.
. "$REPO/slurm/sac_scratch_2t_u5_orterm_idle.env"
export GOAL_ARRIVAL_MAX_SPEED=0
